# Station Workbench (Unbox-family right panes)

Golden: `receiving/workspace/LineEditPanel.tsx`. Full rule + tiers:
`.claude/rules/display/station-workbench.md`. CI: `station-workbench-chrome.guard.test.ts`
(+ `station-terminal.test.ts`). Baselines shrink only — never raise one to pass.

## Always
- Identity: `StationContextBar` flush under GlobalHeader (`placement="flow"` on Unbox + coplanar flush `stationIdentityPanelClass` — `rounded-none`, hairline `border-b`, no elevation) + entity-context adapter (two-row `CartonContextCard`) **above** `StationWorkbench` (`reserveIdentityClearance={false}`, Unbox `bodyGap="none"`) so identity abuts PO lines with zero air.
- **Top padding SoT:** `STATION_IDENTITY_INSET_TOP` (`top-0`) = identity flush under GlobalHeader. `stationIdentityPadClass` is horizontal only (zero `pt`/`pb`). Never host `py-*` under the identity. Unbox push is **flush** (no outer `my-2` / `pr-2` islands) — depth is planes on the shared canvas host.
- Outer shell: `StationPanelRoot` (owns `bg-surface-sunken` column + `StationAmbientWash`).
- Column: `STATION_WORKBENCH_*` (720 lock, start-aligned, zero body pad) from `workbench-layout.ts`. Displays drag min = `STATION_DISPLAYS_MIN_WIDTH_PX` (280).
- Terminal: `useStationTerminalAction` + `STATION_TERMINAL_REGISTRY` (or `TERMINAL_HAND_VM_ALLOWLIST` + follow-up).
- Unbox floor: raised `WorkspaceNotesCard` / `OmnichannelComposerDock` (`chrome="raised"`) with trailing divided Print·Receive (`StationTerminalDock` `embedded` + `embeddedChrome="pill"`). Ghost label-note autocomplete via `useLabelNoteGhostAutocomplete`. Flush two-band procedure floor is parked on `unbox-work` — see `docs/todo/unbox-dock-procedure-parked-HANDOFF.md`. Float uses `slicedActionDockWrapperClass` gutters.
- Tabs: `buildSectionTabs` + `SectionTabsSlider`. Mid-canvas jump: `StationRightEdgeAction`.

## Never
- `max-w-3xl` / local `max-w-[720px]` for a family column (escape: `ds-station-max-w-exempt`).
- Copy the 3-blob ambient wash outside `StationAmbientWash`.
- Hand-roll `relative flex h-full min-h-0 flex-col bg-surface-canvas` outside `StationPanelRoot`.
- Fork a second condensed identity header (only `SupportTicketIdentity` is sanctioned).
- Put carton identity in `StationWorkbench` `entityContext`/`toolbar` (Tier A/B).
- Reintroduce `StationWorkbenchShell`; use `STATION_WORKBENCH_HEADER_COLUMN` for identity/body.
- Co-mount a Band 1 Active Step Studio with Print·Receive on main Unbox (procedure dock is parked). Do not drop ghost autocomplete from the notes bubble.
